msgid "The library folder has to be added to Kodi once:[CR][CR]1. Videos > Files > Add videos...[CR]2. Do not use Browse: select the empty path field (<None>), type the path exactly and press OK:[CR][B]%s[/B][CR]3. Name it e.g. \"AnimeLib\", OK.[CR]4. \"This directory contains\" > TV shows, information provider > \"Local information only\", OK.[CR]5. Confirm refreshing information.[CR][CR]Anime then appears under TV shows; new episodes are added automatically.[CR][CR]Alternatively choose any visible folder (e.g. D:\\Anime) in add-on settings > Kodi library > Library folder, then add that folder the usual way with Browse."
